CHARACTER_SET patrick image.png

BACKGROUND background.png
FADE 1.0

NAME Narrator
TEXT The forest looked strangely peaceful.

WAIT 0.5

NAME Narrator
TEXT Even the placeholder trees looked like they were waiting for a cue.

WAIT 0.5

CHARACTER patrick center 0.0 0.0 1.0

NAME Patrick
TEXT So this is native scale.

WAIT 0.5

NAME Player
TEXT You say that like it's a philosophical achievement.

WAIT 0.5

CHARACTER patrick left -0.1 0.0 0.75

NAME Patrick
TEXT And now I'm smaller.

WAIT 0.5

NAME Narrator
TEXT Patrick looked mildly offended by his reduced rendering footprint.

WAIT 0.5

NAME Player
TEXT It does make the composition feel less aggressive.

WAIT 0.5

CHARACTER patrick right 0.0 0.0 1.5

NAME Patrick
TEXT This feels slightly threatening.

WAIT 0.5

NAME Player
TEXT There it is. The large-sprite menace.

WAIT 0.5

CHARACTER patrick center 0.08 -0.03 1.2

NAME Patrick
TEXT Fine. I'll settle for dramatic instead.

WAIT 0.5

NAME Narrator
TEXT The fog did its best to imply production value.

WAIT 0.5

CHARACTER patrick left 0.18 0.02 0.6

NAME Patrick
TEXT This one feels like I wandered toward the edge of the frame.

WAIT 0.5

NAME Player
TEXT That's because you did.

WAIT 0.5

HIDE_CHARACTER patrick

NAME Narrator
TEXT Patrick returned to the source code.

WAIT 0.5

NAME Player
TEXT Honestly, that was more functional than I expected.

WAIT 0.5

FADE 0.8

NAME Narrator
TEXT End of the longer prototype scene.

END
